Cell["\<\
At step 16 the mean ball scalar curvature of the kept states is -0.60 under \
the first cost and -0.24 without a cost, and the mean ball dimension is 1.84 \
under the second cost and 1.60 without a cost.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1232186413,ExpressionUUID->"2b0fb60e-2211-365f-5934-286857a59ca5"],

Cell["\<\
A kept state of each guided beam at steps 0, 4, 8, 12 and 16, the beam of the \
total curvature above and the beam of dimension 2.5 below, each vertex \
coloured by its Ollivier-Ricci curvature from blue (the state's lowest) to \
red (its highest):\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->655687319,ExpressionUUID->"201a2509-bdd9-2fa1-5039-bd53346c758b"],

